  "body": "## What type of PR is this?\r\n\r\n- [ ] API-change\r\n- [ ] BUG\r\n- [ ] Improvement\r\n- [ ] Documentation\r\n- [ ] Feature\r\n- [ ] Test and CI\r\n- [x] Code Refactoring\r\n\r\n## Which issue(s) this PR fixes:\r\n\r\nissue #23913 \r\n\r\n## What this PR does / why we need it:\r\n\r\n1. Implement geometry type using WKB format.   Original storage used WKT, which is not good.\r\n2. For SRID 4326, used google S2 to compute geodetic length and area.\r\n3. Added functions like convex_hull.\r\n4. Added a type GEOMETRY32, which use float32 instead of float64.\r\n\r\nTODO: Add special fixed length types like POINT2D, POINT3D, POINT2D32 etc, that is more efficient for storing points.\r\nTODO: Use ellipsoid for SRID 4326.   S2 is spherical.  ",
